{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17635","headline":"雨中寒食 · 羊士谔","name":"雨中寒食","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节逢烟雨，园亭但掩关。\n佳人宿妆薄，芳树彩绳闲。\n归思偏消酒，春寒爲近山。\n花枝不可见，别恨灞陵间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}